  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Five Heavenly Court Gu Immortals hunt Lin clan’s first supreme elder for a sword immortal’s aperture and body under Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s orders. Wan Zi Hong names him Lin Jian Xing when she attacks. He answers with sword qi waves and other sword path transformations while they try to trap him in rumor cage.",
      "chapters": [
        2304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "char_wan_zi_hong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The figure they wear down inside the battlefield is only a lump of sword qi from his killer move sword qi takes form. The true Lin Jian Xing stands in the air with his hands behind his back, returns Immortal Gu taken from their outer formation, and asks them to move the fight to a desolate area three thousand li away rather than wreck Lin clan headquarters.",
      "chapters": [
        2304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sword-qi-takes-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_lin_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the barren desert he ruins their plan again, then shows full strength as a pseudo venerable. He wins alone against the five: he kills Wan Zi Hong, severely injures Zhou Xiong Xin, Prince Feng Xian, and Red Heart Traveler, and captures Nine Spiritual Fairy when she covers their retreat. After that battle his name shakes the five regions.",
      "chapters": [
        2305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pseudo-venerable-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_prince_feng_xian",
        "char_red_heart_traveler",
        "char_nine_spiritual_fairy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration states Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s earlier deduction was not wrong: Lin Jian Xing is an otherworldly demon who was head of a Sword Sect in his former world and known as the Grand Ancestor. He is happy to be treated as a demonic path member so Lin clan can expand without righteous-path restraints, and he aims to become a sword path venerable before a venerable victor forces submission. Heavenly Court wanted his body to create Bo Qing against Spectral Soul Demon Venerable; he instead releases Nine Spiritual Fairy for eleven eight-desolate sword leaf trees and a demand that also includes heavy sand. He is called the number one Gu Immortal in the present Western Desert.",
      "chapters": [
        2317
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "otherworldly-demon-and-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    }
  ],
